# ChipDocs.org Clean-Room Cadence Allegro / OrCAD PCB Editor Footprint Script
# Component: NRF52840-QIAA-R | Package: C190794_AQFN-73-EP_7x7 | Standard: IPC-7351B Quad (AQFN-73-EP(7x7))
# Usage: In Allegro PCB Editor Command Window -> replay C190794_AQFN-73-EP_7x7.scr
version 17.4
setwindow pcb
new
newdrawfillin "C190794_AQFN-73-EP_7x7.dra" "Package Symbol"
