setwindow form.prmedit
FORM prmedit units Millimeter
FORM prmedit accuracy 3
FORM prmedit width 28.16
FORM prmedit height 28.16
FORM prmedit x -14.08
FORM prmedit y -14.08
FORM prmedit done
setwindow pcb

